cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use comfort-db in published work, please cite this software and the
  COMFORT dataset (Korablev and Olsen, 2022, doi:10.11582/2022.00039).
type: software
title: "comfort-db"
abstract: >-
  Python library for loading, preprocessing and exploring the COMFORT
  oceanographic SQLite dataset: Quality, space and time filtering, unit
  conversions, TEOS-10 variables, gridding, profile and water-mass analysis,
  plotting and an interactive dashboard.
